Wicked Engine
=============

Three effects follow the approach of Wicked Engine's water effects:

- the god-ray shafts of the underwater composite (ocean_underwater.frag);
- the waterline distortion of the underwater composite (ocean_underwater.frag);
- the intersection foam at the waterline of the ocean surface
  (ocean_surface.glsl).

Both shader files are in Engine/Modules/Rendering/Shaders/Ocean.

